sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant SB as Service Bus
  participant W as Worker
  C->>A: POST /v1/scans<br/>Idempotency-Key optional
  A->>A: derive tenant from API key
  A->>A: generate idempotency key if missing
  A->>DB: BEGIN + lock tenant/month
  A->>DB: validate allowlist + quota + active scans
  A->>DB: INSERT scan PENDING or return idempotent replay
  A->>DB: COMMIT
  alt new scan
    A->>SB: scan.requested versioned<br/>sessionId=tenantId
  end
  A-->>C: 201/200 scanId + idempotency metadata
  W->>SB: accept tenant session
  W->>W: validate message contract version
  W->>DB: acquire attempt if PENDING
  W->>DB: mark IN_PROGRESS
  W->>W: resource preflight + module timeouts
  W->>DB: save full result in scan_results
  W->>DB: update result_summary + DONE/FAILED
  W->>SB: complete message
  C->>A: GET /v1/scans/{scanId}
  A->>DB: tenant-filtered read
  A-->>C: status + summary/result
